{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"储能","country":"菲律宾","country_iso":"PHL","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:42:11.969229","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"PHL-ES-0001","ldc":"No","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"菲律宾185MWh储能项目","project_name_en":"Philippines 185MWh Battery Energy Storage System Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"海博思创","content":"2025年10月，全球领先的储能系统解决方案与技术服务提供商海博思创在菲律宾市场实现双喜临门。公司于10月10日正式启用位于马尼拉BGC金融区的办公室，并于一周后的10月17日成功签署服务于当地市场的185MWh大型储能系统项目。这一系列紧密的战略举措，标志着海博思创在东南亚市场迈出了坚实一步，展现了其深耕菲律宾及东南亚市场的决心。\n海博思创菲律宾子公司坐落于马尼拉核心商务区的菲律宾证券交易大厦，其成立旨在成为辐射东南亚区域的运营枢纽。随着新办公室的开业，公司在该国的首个突破性大型储能项目也实现成功签约，充分体现了公司的市场竞争力与品牌影响力。\n在项目签约仪式上，客户方高度评价了该项目对菲律宾能源转型和增强电网稳定性的重要意义。海博思创国际业务高级副总裁邱长斌先生表示：“我们非常荣幸能凭借领先的技术实力与丰富的全球项目经验，为客户提供可靠的储能解决方案。此次成功签约，是海博思创综合实力的体现，也是我们与本地伙伴建立长期战略合作的起点。”\n此次中标185MWh项目，充分印证了海博思创在大型储能领域的综合实力已获得当地市场的认可。\n海博思创拥有14年行业经验，全球参与储能项目超过300个，累计装机容量超40GWh。凭借深厚的技术积淀与成功的国际项目经验，海博思创已整装待发，致力于为菲律宾及整个东南亚地区迈向可持续、高韧性的能源未来贡献核心力量。","content_sha256":"a7f80f517f0e55e83441edb5aa9bf05cc61e185142b4fd6e04d0e11ad2b56c61","id":1522,"publish_date":"2025-10-21 20:50:59","title":"海博思创菲律宾大型储能项目签约 推进东南亚市场布局","title_sha256":"9fff61568ad907835ed2cad3d8dfdac3fdc30ca0fc7e053166ede7c04c369ad5","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/88988.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"PHL-ES-0001","capacity_details":"BESS: 185MWh","capacity_mw":185.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"185","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:42:11.969441","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"PHL-ES-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.cnesa.org/information/detail/?column_id=4&id=7567\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"北京海博思创科技股份有限公司","project_developer_en":"Beijing Hi-Brain Technology Co., Ltd.","project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"海博思创在菲律宾签约了一个185MWh的大型储能系统项目。该项目是海博思创在东南亚市场的战略布局之一，旨在提升当地电网的稳定性和能源转型。项目目前处于签约阶段。","publish_date":"2025-10-21 20:50:59","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/88988.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":185.0,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"PHL-ES-0001","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["existing_storage_numeric","storage_text_signal"]}
